| :-----: | ----------- |
| `segment` | A runtime-sized, internally dense segment of values |
| `output` | 1D memref of integer or floating-point values |
| `captures` | variadic of integer or floating-point |


#### `swage.program_id` (swage::ProgramIdOp)

_Id of the current logical fixed-block program along an axis_

Syntax:

```
operation ::= `swage.program_id` $axis attr-dict
```

Returns the coordinate of the current logical fixed-block program along
the given axis. This is a logical program coordinate, not a GPU thread or
block id.

